      hu: ["A Butești-zátony hossza meghaladja a 2000 métert a Camenca völgyében.", "A helyi barlangokban 22 állatfaj, köztük mamutok csontjait találták meg.", "A mészkőképződmény korát körülbelül 15-20 millió évre becsülik.", "A sziklafalak magassága egyes szakaszokon eléri a 40 métert.", "A szurdok fontos állomása a Glodeni járás ökoturisztikai útvonalainak.", "A terület 1975 óta áll állami természetvédelmi oltalom alatt."],
      ro: ["Stânca Butești are o lungime de 2 km și o lățime maximă de 125 m.", "În grota de la Butești s-au găsit resturi fosile de mamut și ren.", "Formațiunea este alcătuită din calcare organogene de vârstă sarmațiană.", "Arheologii au descoperit unelte de cremene datând din epoca de piatră.", "Râul Camenca a tăiat acest recif formând un defileu spectaculos.", "Situl este inclus în lista ariilor protejate din Republica Moldova din 1975."],
      en: ["The Butești reef extends for 2 kilometers and is up to 125 meters wide.", "Fossils of 22 prehistoric animal species were discovered in the local caves.", "The limestone was formed from colonial algae and mollusks in the Miocene.", "Paleolithic settlement layers indicate continuous use by early humans.", "The Camenca River valley narrows significantly as it passes the gorge.", "It was officially designated as a protected geological monument in 1975."],
